<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="3."><l>So now today we’re coinhering.</l><l>We dwell in Him, and He is dwelling in us.</l><l>We’re in the sweet incorporation</l><l>of God and man, how glorious!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
